346 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 145 0 R
/E (The main aim of this project is to develop a web-based Polling Booth System that allows users to cast their votes digitally in a secure and efficient manner. The system is designed to simplify the voting process, reduce manual work, and provide instant election results.)
/Pg 19 0 R
/K [5]
>>
endobj
347 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 145 0 R
/E (The objectives of this project include developing a user-friendly interface that allows users to easily navigate through the system and cast their vote without any difficulty. The system aims to ensure that each voter can vote only once by implementing proper validation techniques. Another important objective is to store all voting data securely using browser Local Storage and to retrieve this data accurately for result generation. The project also aims to provide an admin module for viewing election results and managing election data. Additionally, the project helps students gain practical exposure to real-time web application development.)
/Pg 19 0 R
/K [6]
>>
endobj
