360 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 146 0 R
/E (This research paper presents the development of a web-based online voting system specially designed for educational institutions. The system allows students to log in using their unique credentials and cast votes electronically. The voting data is stored digitally, and the results are generated automatically. The study highlights that the system reduces manual work, increases transparency, and saves time during elections. It also improves the overall efficiency of the election process in colleges and universities.)
/Pg 20 0 R
/K [11]
>>
endobj
