365 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 146 0 R
/E (This paper focuses on the implementation of a secure electronic voting system using modern web technologies such as HTML, CSS, and JavaScript. The system includes user authentication and vote verification features to prevent duplicate voting. The study emphasizes the importance of client-side validation and secure data handling techniques. The results show that web-based voting systems are reliable and suitable for small-scale applications.)
/Pg 20 0 R
/K [16]
>>
endobj
