/P 146 0 R
/E (This research work describes the use of browser-based Local Storage for storing voting data in a web-based voting application. The proposed system eliminates the need for backend servers and databases. The authors explain how Local Storage can be used effectively for handling user data, voting records, and result generation. The study concludes that Local Storage is suitable for small voting systems where high scalability is not required.)
/Pg 20 0 R
/K [21]
>>
