380 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 147 0 R
/E (This paper presents a digital polling system developed using HTML, CSS, and JavaScript. The system provides a simple user interface for voters and a separate admin panel for result monitoring. The system ensures that each user can vote only once and that results are updated in real time. The authors state that the system is cost-effective and can be easily implemented in schools, colleges, and small organizations.)
/Pg 21 0 R
/K [9]
>>
endobj
