385 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 147 0 R
/E (This research focuses on the design and implementation of an online voting system for small-scale elections such as classroom voting and internal organizational polls. The system uses web technologies and provides fast and accurate result generation. The study highlights that online voting increases participation, reduces human errors, and ensures quick result declaration. The paper concludes that such systems are highly beneficial in academic and organizational environments.)
/Pg 21 0 R
/K [14]
>>
