/E (6.4 Activity Diagram)
/Pg 36 0 R
/K [14]
>>
endobj
804 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 162 0 R
/E (The activity diagram shows the flow of activities performed in the system. The process begins with user registration or login, followed by voter authentication. Once authenticated, the user proceeds to vote casting. After successful voting, the data is stored and the session ends. The admin can then view the results and manage the election data.)
/Pg 36 0 R
/K [15]
>>
endobj
