814 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 163 0 R
/E (After implementing and testing the Polling Booth System, various test cases were executed to verify its functionality. Multiple users were allowed to log in and cast their votes. The system successfully prevented users from voting more than once. All votes were stored correctly in Local Storage, and the results were updated in real time. The system performed smoothly without any major technical issues. The user interface was found to be simple and easy to use, even for users with basic computer knowledge. The results indicate that the system is reliable, accurate, and suitable for small-scale election processes)
/Pg 37 0 R
/K [9]
>>
endobj
